<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intl Telecom started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intl Telecom started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst Patrick Burton started coverage of International Telecommunications Data Systems Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-month price target of $26 per share.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1/8 to 19-1/2.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
